        "Portal、Search、Auth、Capabilities 与 WAIT_DB 路径仍不能安全移除 Flask。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Shared Boundary",
      "items": [
        "FastAPI 与 Flask 复用 Service、Contract 和 Database Provider。",
